    "enUS": {
      "description": "Hello, warrior!  You show a lot of promise, but you still need to learn some tricks and Muren Stormpike is just the dwarf to teach you.\n\nYou can find Muren at the Hall of Arms in the Military Ward of Ironforge.  Talk to him when you're ready to learn what it is to be a warrior.",
      "summary": "Speak with Muren Stormpike.",
      "title": "Muren Stormpike",
